-- HVM4 in hyperactivity: the Interaction Calculus runtime of HigherOrderCO/HVM4 (src/hvm.c), its
-- parser, its reduction to weak normal form, its normalizer, its collapser and its printer, on a
-- flat heap of 64-bit terms laid out as the C lays them out: TAG (8 bits, the top bit the
-- substitution mark) | EXT (24 bits) | VAL (32 bits). Every rule is the C's rule, and fresh labels
-- and fresh names come in the C's order; where a rule allocates several blocks the order of the
-- blocks may differ, which no output observes. hv4 FILE.hvm [-C[N]] prints what src/hvm runs.
import "native-opt.hypercubical"
import "hvm2.hypercubical"

